OL,3,GNEWSACarer who murdered vulnerable
OL,4,Ateenager and claimed her benefits dies
OL,5,Ain jail
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who murdered a vulnerable
OL,8,Fteenager in her care and covered up the
OL,9,Fkilling for years while fraudulently
OL,10,Fclaiming her benefits has died in
OL,11,Fprison.
OL,13,FAvril Jones, 66, and her partner Edward
OL,14,FCairney - who died aged 82 in 2023 -
OL,15,Fmurdered Margaret Fleming around the
OL,16,Fturn of the century.
OL,18,FMargaret, 19, was not formally reported
OL,19,Fas missing until 2016 and her body has
OL,20,Fnever been found.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
